# createModel(Player player)
# Port of _/create. Builds the display-entity tree at the player's
# feet (the original used relative ~ coords from the command's executor,
# so the summon is wrapped in 'execute at {{player}}').
#
# The original also created the gm_cam_client scoreboard objective here;
# that's gone - camera-viewer gamemode is now tracked in the per-player
# `savedGameMode` MSC variable instead.
@using project
@fast

@bypass execute at {{player}} run summon block_display ~-0.5 ~-0.5 ~-0.5 {Tags:["project","project_root"]}
@bypass execute at {{player}} run summon block_display ~ ~ ~ {Tags:["project","project_camera"]}
@bypass data merge entity @e[type=block_display,tag=project_camera,distance=..1,limit=1,sort=nearest] {teleport_duration:2}
